{"id":1020302,"name":"데렌·심문 II","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"데렌·심문 II","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1020302]}],"trial":{"trial_id":20302,"stage":"2단계","unlock_time":"2023-04-11 14:00:00","diary1":"휴식 구역을 지나가던 당신은 우연히 연습 중인 루비아.레이를 만났고, 루비아.레이에게서 데렌 및 데렌의 5년 전 그 영화에 관한 정보를 조사해보기로 했다.","diary2":"영화의 편집판을 다 보고 나자, 데렌이 당신들 앞에 나타나 영화가 당신들에게 어떤 이미지를 남겼는지 물었다.\n　　데렌은 당신들의 대답에 별 감흥이 없는 듯했고, 당신이 계속해서 질문하려 할 때, 데렌은 <무도회의 수첩>에 관한 수첩을 남긴 채 저 멀리 가버린 상태였다.","evidence":[{"ID":260329,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260330,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120302001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120302002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120302003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120302004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120302005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120302006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120302007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120302008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120302009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120302010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120302011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120302012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120302013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120302014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120302015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120302016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":3,"dialogue_id":120302017,"next":[18]},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120302018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120302019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120302020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120302021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120302022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120302023,"next":null},{"step":24,"cou